  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/mysticalagradditions?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/mysticalagriculture_required.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"92\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/mysticalautomation_ad.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"84\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-agradditions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/downloads&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-agradditions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-agradditions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/mc_version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fmysticalagradditions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&message=view&color=brightgreen&style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組為<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Agriculture</a> 添加了額外內容。</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">第 6 級精華：Insanium！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為高階素材種植第 6 級作物，包含下界之星、覺醒龍銅、中子礦等！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Paxel 工具：將鎬、斧與鏟的功能整合於單一工具之中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完美整合《Tinkers' Construct》！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">精華煤：可燒煉的物品數量優於普通煤炭。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>資源作物</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong><em>最後更新版本：7.0.2</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>原版資源：&nbsp;</strong>下界之星、龍蛋</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>Botania：&nbsp;</strong>蓋亞之靈</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>Draconic Evolution：&nbsp;</strong>覺醒龍銅</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em>Avaritia： </em></strong><em>中子礦</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em>Powah： </em></strong><em>硝晶&nbsp;</em></span></li>\n</ul>",
